  "rubric": "# A thirty-second film for one prospect\n\nReview against the film quality bar (brain spec 2026-09-30-template-film-quality-bar): watch the full render at 1x with sound, then check the 1 fps contact sheet. Six overlapping beats (open 0 to 4.8 s, idea 3.9 to 9.9, pain 9 to 15.2, proof 14.3 to 20.7, ask 19.8 to 25.6, call to action 24.7 to 30). No frame shows only the background between beats. The first name fills the open, the proof number fills the proof beat, every line is read at 1x, and the pain sentence balances on at most two lines at 70 characters.",
  "provenance": {
    "label": "CueFrame, outbound reference film",
    "notes": "Built through the staging MCP with the card motion runtime, the dither-gradient-bg primitive and the CC0 music and SFX packs. Sample logo is the CueFrame wordmark; a row supplies the prospect logo."
  },
