      "Music bed and hits"
    ],
    "prompt": "Make a 30-second personal outbound film for one prospect from a table row: their first name, company, pain, the outcome we sell, one proof number with its label, their logo and a call to action. Kinetic type over a moving espresso and amber ground, a music bed and hits on every beat change.",
